{"ticker":"PG","updated":"2026-10-30T23:05:43Z","profile":{"longName":"The Procter & Gamble Company","shortName":"Procter & Gamble Company (The)","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Household & Personal Products","country":"United States","website":"https://www.pginvestor.com","fullTimeEmployees":104000,"marketCap":374484238336,"trailingPE":24.332832,"forwardPE":21.84701,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":4.259278,"pegRatio":4.13,"targetMeanPrice":173.65218,"targetHighPrice":190.0,"targetLowPrice":151.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":23,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.04,"earningsGrowth":0.008,"grossMargins":0.50591,"operatingMargins":0.26872998,"profitMargins":0.18229,"totalRevenue":87921999872,"beta":0.377,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":167.25,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":137.62,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.71},"summary":"The Procter & Gamble Company provides branded consumer packaged goods worldwide. It operates through five segments: Beauty; Grooming; Health Care; Fabric & Home Care; and Baby, Feminine & Family Care. The company offers conditioners, shampoos, styling aids, and treatments under the Head & Shoulders, Herbal Essences, Pantene, and Rejoice brands; antiperspirants, deodorants, and personal cleansing products under the Native, Old Spice, Safeguard, and Secret brands; and facial moisturizers, cleaners, and treatments under the Olay and SK-II brands. It also provides blades, razors, shave products, appliances, and other grooming products under the Braun, Gillette, and Venus brands. In addition, the company offers toothbrushes, toothpastes, and other oral care products under the Crest and Oral-B brands; and gastrointestinal, pain relief, rapid diagnostics, respiratory, vitamins/minerals/supplements, and other personal health care products under the Metamucil, Neurobion, Pepto-Bismol, and Vicks brands. Further, it provides fabric enhancers, and laundry additives and detergents under the Ariel, Downy, Gain, and Tide brands; and air and dish care, P&G professional, and surface care under the Cascade, Dawn, Fairy, Febreze, Mr. Clean, and Swiffer brands. Additionally, the company offers baby wipes, taped diapers, and pants under the Luvs and Pampers brands; adult incontinence and menstrual ","summary_zh":"寶潔公司在全球提供品牌消費品。它透過五個部門運作：美容；儀容；衛生保健;織物及家居護理；以及嬰兒、女性和家庭護理。該公司以海飛絲、Herbal Essences、潘婷和飄柔品牌提供護髮素、洗髮精、造型助劑和護理產品； Native、Old Spice、Safeguard 和 Secret 品牌的止汗劑、除臭劑和個人清潔產品；玉蘭油和 SK-II 品牌的臉部保濕霜、清潔劑和護理產品。它還提供博朗、吉列和維納斯品牌的刀片、剃刀、剃須產品、電器和其他美容產品。此外，該公司還提供 Crest 和 Oral-B 品牌的牙刷、牙膏和其他口腔護理產品； Metamucil、Neurobion、Pepto-Bismol 和 Vicks 品牌下的胃腸道、止痛、快速診斷、呼吸、維生素/礦物質/補充劑以及其他個人保健產品。此外，它還提供 Ariel、Downy、Gain 和 Tide 品牌的織物增強劑、洗衣添加劑和洗滌劑； Cascade、Dawn、Fairy、Febreze、Mr. Clean 和 Swiffer 品牌下的空氣和餐具護理、寶潔專業護理和表面護理。此外，該公司還提供 Luvs 和 Pampers 品牌的嬰兒濕紙巾、膠帶尿布和褲子；成人失禁和月經","sector_zh":"消費者防禦","industry_zh":"居家及個人產品","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":157.36,"h":158.86,"l":156.98,"c":157.99,"v":6432800},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":157.65,"h":158.64,"l":156.5,"c":158.17,"v":6592500},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":158.52,"h":159.75,"l":157.81,"c":159.19,"v":6934900},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":158.55,"h":160.56,"l":158.41,"c":160.02,"v":6436200},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":159.61,"h":160.27,"l":158.25,"c":159.01,"v":7178400},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":158.61,"h":159.87,"l":158.2,"c":159.46,"v":4984900},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":158.6,"h":158.94,"l":155.89,"c":157.35,"v":6205500},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":157.72,"h":159.35,"l":157.39,"c":158.63,"v":5819500},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":157.93,"h":159.13,"l":157.78,"c":157.9,"v":5957000},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":157.88,"h":158.52,"l":156.2,"c":156.83,"v":5995000},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":157.14,"h":158.39,"l":156.89,"c":158.05,"v":6559600},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":158.43,"h":161.67,"l":158.43,"c":160.33,"v":6764200},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":158.15,"h":159.02,"l":157.16,"c":157.32,"v":7651500},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":157.61,"h":157.62,"l":155.97,"c":156.04,"v":17224800},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":156.08,"h":156.08,"l":153.05,"c":153.07,"v":8712900},{"t":"2025-09