":[{"name":"財報","count":2},{"name":"雲端/軟體","count":1},{"name":"併購","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-08-04","period":"2026-06-30","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/80424/000008042426000103/pg-20260630.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"The Procter & Gamble Company (the Company) is a world-leading multinational consumer goods company focused on providing trusted, branded products of superior quality, performance and value to improve the lives of consumers around the world - now and for generations to come. Our products are sold in about 180 countries and territories throughout the world. The Company was incorporated in Ohio in 1905, having first been established as a New Jersey corporation in 1890, and was built from a business founded in Cincinnati in 1837 by William Procter and James Gamble.","zh":"寶潔公司（以下簡稱「本公司」）是一家世界領先的跨國消費品公司，致力於提供值得信賴的優質、性能和價值卓越的品牌產品，以改善世界各地消費者現在和子孫後代的生活。我們的產品銷往全球約180個國家。該公司於 1905 年在俄亥俄州註冊成立，最初於 1890 年作為新澤西州公司成立，其前身是 William Procter 和 James Gamble 於 1837 年在辛辛那提創立的企業。"},{"en":"Business Model. Our business model is focused on delivering sustainable value creation by driving balanced top- and bottom-line growth. We create, manufacture, market and distribute a diversified portfolio of daily-use products to delight consumers with irresistible superiority across five key vectors - product performance, packaging, brand communication, retail execution and value. We invest in research and development and consumer insights to invent new categories or products and innovate our existing products, ensuring they meet evolving consumer needs and preferences. We leverage marketing strategies including advertising, promotions and endorsements to drive brand awareness and loyalty among consumers. The Company utilizes various distribution channels, including retail stores, digital commerce platforms and direct-to-consumer platforms to deliver our products. Our business model re","zh":"商業模式。我們的業務模式專注於透過推動營收和利潤的平衡成長來創造可持續的價值。我們創造、製造、行銷和分銷多元化的日常用品組合，在產品性能、包裝、品牌傳播、零售執行和價值這五個關鍵方面以不可抗拒的優勢取悅消費者。我們投資於研發和消費者洞察，以發明新的類別或產品，並對現有產品進行創新，確保它們滿足不斷變化的消費者需求和偏好。我們利用廣告、促銷和代言等行銷策略來提高消費者的品牌知名度和忠誠度。該公司利用各種分銷管道，包括零售店、數位商務平台和直接面向消費者的平台來交付我們的產品。我們的商業模式重新"},{"en":"Key Customers. Our customers include mass merchandisers, digital commerce (including social commerce) channels, grocery stores, membership club stores, drug stores, department stores, distributors, wholesalers, specialty beauty stores (including airport duty-free stores), high-frequency stores, pharmacies, electronics stores and professional channels. We also sell direct to consumers. Sales to Walmart Inc. and its affiliates represent approximately 16% of our total sales in 2026, 2025 and 2024. No other customer represents more than 10% of our total sales. Our top ten customers accounted for approximately 43% of our total net sales in 2026 and 2025 and 42% in 2024.","zh":"主要客戶。我們的客戶包括量販店、數位商務（包括社交商務）通路、雜貨店、會員俱樂部商店、藥局、百貨公司、經銷商、批發商、專業美容店（包括機場免稅店）、高頻商店、藥局、電子商店和專業通路。我們也直接向消費者銷售。 2026 年、2025 年及 2024 年，沃爾瑪公司及其附屬公司的銷售額約占我們總銷售額的 16%。沒有其他客戶占我們總銷售額的 10% 以上。 2026年和2025年，我們的十大客戶約占我們總淨銷售額的43%，2024年佔42%。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Key Customers. Our customers include mass merchandisers, digital commerce (including social commerce) channels, grocery stores, membership club stores, drug stores, department stores, distributors, wholesalers, specialty beauty stores (including airport duty-free stores), high-frequency stores, pharmacies, electronics stores and professional channels. We also sell direct to consumers. Sales to Walmart Inc. and its affiliates represent approximately 16% of our total sales in 2026, 2025 and 2024. No other customer represents more than 10% of our total sales. Our top ten customers accounted for approximately 43% of our total net sales in 2026 and 2025 and 42% in 2024.","zh":"主要客戶。我們的客戶包括量販店、數位商務（包括社交商務）通路、雜貨店、會員俱樂部商店、藥局、百貨公司、經銷商、批發商、專業美容店（包括機場免稅店）、高頻商店、藥局、電子商店和專業通路。我們也直接向消費者銷售。 2026 年、2025 年及 2024 年，沃爾瑪公司及其附屬公司的銷售額約占我們總銷售額的 16%。沒有其他客戶占我們總銷售額的 10% 以上。 2026年和2025年，我們的十大客戶約占我們總淨銷售額的43%，2024年佔42%。"}],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2026-06-30","items":[{"name":"Fabric Home Care","val":30314000000,"zh":"織物家庭護理部門"},{"name":"Baby Feminine Family Care","val":20401000000,"zh":"嬰兒女性家庭護理部門"},{"name":"Beauty","val":16023000000,"zh":"美容部門"},{"name":"Health Care","val":12456000000,"zh":"醫療保健部門"},{"name":"Grooming","val":6918000000,"zh":"美容部門"}],"total":87032000000},"geo":{"end":"2026-06-30","items":[{"name":"Non Us","val":45300000000,"zh":"非我們"},{"name":"US","val":41700000000,"zh":"美國"}],"total":87032000000}},"peers":["JNJ","KO","MRK","HD","VZ"]}}